s \u20ac 3.690,00.\n\n\\- Smoking is not allowed in the flat.\n\n\\- Pets are not allowed in the property.\n\n**Income requirement**\n\nWe apply an income requirement of 3.5 times the rent gross as (joint) income. If you do not meet this requirement, you can apply with a guarantor who meets the income requirement and lives and works in the Netherlands. A maximum of one guarantor is possible per application.\n\nIf you apply as a foreign student, the above-mentioned income and guarantor requirements will not apply and we will discuss the substantiation of your financial profile following your application.\n\n**Interested?**\n\nIf you are interested, please respond to the advertisement or send us an e-mail at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*. This is because we only schedule our viewings by e-mail. We look forward to getting in touch with you.","image":"https:\/\/casco-media-prod.global.ssl.fastly.net\/fa483e5e-051c-5bd9-8de1-c969fc82e942\/1545828793eeed803666bcb6fb8c801f.jpg?width=600&auto=webp","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Vlaggemanstraat","addressLocality":"Rotterdam","addressRegion":"Bergpolder","postalCode":"3038LG"},"numberOfRooms":[{"@type":"QuantitativeValue","value":4,"unitText":"room"}],"floorSize":{"@type":"QuantitativeValue","value":100,"unitText":"MTK"},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","businessFunction":"sell","price":"1845.00","priceCurrency":"EUR","validFrom":"2025-10-20","url":"https:\/\/www.pararius.com\/apartment-for-rent\/rotterdam\/fa483e5e\/vlaggemanstraat","availability":"http:\/\/schema.org\/LimitedAvailability","image":"https:\/\/casco-media-prod.global.ssl.fastly.net\/fa483e5e-051c-5bd9-8de1-c969fc82e942\/1545828793eeed803666bcb6fb8c801f.jpg?width=600&auto=webp"}}
