                <h2 class="listing-detail-description__title">Description</h2>

                                    
                    <p><strong>Students only!</strong></p>
<p>Spacious ground-floor apartment with garden - Vlaggemanstraat, Rotterdam-North</p>
<p>This modern ground-floor apartment with a basement and garden is located in a lively neighborhood just north of Rotterdam’s city center, an ideal spot for students! The university and colleges are easily accessible, whether you prefer to cycle or take public transport. In the immediate vicinity, you’ll find a variety of trendy restaurants, several supermarkets, bakeries and more.</p>
<p><strong>Layout</strong></p>
<p>The apartment has a private entrance leading into a spacious living room with semi-open kitchen (approx. 27 m²). The kitchen comes equipped with a gas cooker, extractor hood and dishwasher and provides direct access to the spacious backyard of about 45 m².</p>
<p>On this level, there is also a bedroom (approx. 9 m²) and a bathroom (approx. 4 m²) fitted with a shower, washbasin, towel radiator, and toilet.</p>
<p>The souterrain includes a second bedroom (approx. 11 m²) and an additional room (approx. 14 m²) that is ideal as a study, guest room, or hobby space. There is also a separate area with two washbasins, offering extra convenience.</p>
<p><strong>Features</strong></p>
<p>The property has energy label B, is fully equipped with plastic frames with double glazing and is heated by a central heating combi boiler.</p>
<p>The property will be delivered as shown on the photos.</p>
<p><strong>Acceptance</strong></p>
<p>- The rental price of 1.845,00 does not include energy, water, television and internet. You need to take care of these contracts yourself.</p>
<p>- The property is available immediately for a fixed term with a maximum of 21 months.</p>
<p>- The property is suitable for a maximum of two people (only students from other municipalities or countries allowed).</p>
<p>- The deposit is € 3.690,00.</p>
<p>- Smoking is not allowed in the flat.</p>
<p>- Pets are not allowed in the property.</p>
<p><strong>Income requirement</strong></p>
<p>We apply an income requirement of 3.5 times the rent gross as (joint) income. If you do not meet this requirement, you can apply with a guarantor who meets the income requirement and lives and works in the Netherlands. A maximum of one guarantor is possible per application.</p>
<p>If you apply as a foreign student, the above-mentioned income and guarantor requirements will not apply and we will discuss the substantiation of your financial profile following your application.</p>
<p><strong>Interested?</strong></p>
<p>If you are interested, please respond to the advertisement or send us an e-mail at ******. This is because we only schedule our viewings by e-mail. We look forward to getting in touch with you.</p>
